    [4832]={name="Mystic Sarong",quality=2,ilvl=29,reqLevel=24,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Wenna Silkbeard.",zone="Eastern Kingdoms",npc="Wenna Silkbeard"},
    [4833]={name="Glorious Shoulders",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=23,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Wenna Silkbeard.",zone="Eastern Kingdoms",npc="Wenna Silkbeard"},
    [4835]={name="Elite Shoulders",quality=2,ilvl=30,reqLevel=25,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Wenna Silkbeard.",zone="Eastern Kingdoms",npc="Wenna Silkbeard"},
    [4910]={name="Painted Chain Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Hunt Begins'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Grull Hawkwind in Mulgore. Objective: Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to bring him 7 Plainstrider Feathers and 7 pieces of Plainstrider Meat.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="The Hunt Begins",lore="You have a promising air about you, and will prove yourself to the tribe. Perhaps someday soon you will be welcomed into the great city of Thunder Bluff."},
    [4922]={name="Jagged Chain Vest",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Burning Blade Medallion'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Zureetha Fargaze in Durotar. Objective: Bring the Burning Blade Medallion to Zureetha Fargaze, outside The Den.",zone="Valley of Trials",questName="Burning Blade Medallion",lore="Through my divinations, I see that an item of power hides deep within the Burning Blade Coven, guarded by beasts and black magic. It is called the Burning Blade Medallion, and your next task is to find it and remove it from the coven."},
    [4933]={name="Seasoned Fighter's Cloak",quality=1,ilvl=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Thwarting Kolkar Aggression'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Lar Prowltusk in Durotar. Objective: Lar Prowltusk outside of Sen'jin Village wants you to destroy the 3 sets of Attack Plans held within Kolkar Crag.",zone="Durotar",questName="Thwarting Kolkar Aggression",lore="Lower your voice. The Kolkar centaurs lie just over the ridge to the west in Kolkar Crag."},
    [4935]={name="Wide Metal Girdle",quality=1,ilvl=8,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'From The Wreckage....'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gar'Thok in Durotar. Objective: Gar'Thok of Razor Hill wants you to retrieve 3 Gnomish Tools from the wreckage off the coast.",zone="Durotar",questName="From The Wreckage....",lore="One of my most observant scouts brings back word that the wreckage of Proudmoore's fleet still remains off the coast of Durotar, just east of Tiragarde Keep."},
    [4944]={name="Handsewn Cloak",quality=1,ilvl=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Lost But Not Forgotten'. Starts with Misha Tor'kren in Durotar. Objective: Bring a sign of Kron's fate to Misha Tor'kren at the farmstead northwest of Razor Hill.",zone="Durotar",questName="Lost But Not Forgotten",lore="please, can you help me? My son Kron went hunting days ago, and he still hasn't returned. He went west towards the Barrens to hunt crocolisks along Southfury River."},
    [4946]={name="Lightweight Boots",quality=1,ilvl=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Zalazane'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Master Gadrin in Durotar. Objective: Defeat Zalazane.Kill 8 Voodoo Trolls and 8 Hexed Trolls.Bring Zalazane's Head to Gadrin.",zone="Durotar",questName="Zalazane",lore="The witchdoctor Zalazane dwells on the Echo Isles to the east. They are the isles we once called home. From there he sends his trolls to the mainland, to hex our people and drag more of them under his sway."},
    [4967]={name="Tribal Warrior's Shield",quality=1,ilvl=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Preparation for Ceremony'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Eyahn Eagletalon in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Collect 6 Azure Feathers and 6 Bronze Feathers, and bring them to Eyahn Eagletalon in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Preparation for Ceremony",lore="my brother soon stands before Chief Bloodhoof, and it is my honor to make his headdress for him. I want to ask a favor of you while I finish tanning these leather straps."},
    [4969]={name="Fortified Bindings",quality=1,ilvl=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dwarven Digging'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Baine Bloodhoof in Mulgore. Objective: Collect 5 Prospector's Picks.At a forge, smash the Prospector's Picks to create Broken Tools.Bring 5 Broken Tools to Baine Bloodhoof in Bloodhoof Village.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Dwarven Digging",lore="There are dwarves preparing a dig site to the northwest. They think secrets lie in the earth, and that is true, but hollowing and defiling the land is no way to earn its teachings."},
    [4972]={name="Cliff Runner Boots",quality=1,ilvl=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mazzranache'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Maur Raincaller in Mulgore. Objective: Bring a Prairie Wolf Heart, Flatland Cougar Femur, Plainstrider Scale and Swoop Gizzard to Maur Raincaller at Bloodhoof Village.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Mazzranache",lore="My grandfather told me stories about his battles with a strider named Mazzranache. He told me of its demonic red eyes, razor-sharp talons and venomous bite."},
    [4975]={name="Vigilant Buckler",quality=2,ilvl=39,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Malin's Request'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Skuerto in Stormwind City. Objective: Take the Sealed Letter to Archmage Malin in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind.",zone="Arathi Highlands",questName="Malin's Request",lore="Take this letter back to Stormwind and let Malin know that Kryten an' I'll be home soon. He'll reward you well for helping us here, of that I've no doubt."},
    [4977]={name="Sword of Hammerfall",quality=2,ilvl=41,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Real Threat'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Korin Fel in Arathi Highlands. Objective: Slay Or'Kalar and bring his Head to Korin Fel in the Hammerfall outpost.",zone="Arathi Highlands",questName="The Real Threat",lore="You serve my husband well, but he does not know why Hammerfall is under attack."},
    [4978]={name="Ryedol's Hammer",quality=2,ilvl=36,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Dwarf and His Tools'. Starts with Prospector Ryedol in Badlands. Objective: Find Ryedol's Lucky Pick and return it to Prospector Ryedol south of Hammertoe's Dig Site.",zone="Badlands",questName="A Dwarf and His Tools",lore="Hey. Be careful 'round here. There be Dark Iron dwarves all around--looked like the Shadowforge clan. They just attacked the excavation site I was workin' at--killed nearly everyone there, including my boss Hammertoe."},
    [4987]={name="Dwarf Captain's Sword",quality=2,ilvl=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'An Ambassador of Evil'. Starts with Historian Karnik in Ironforge. Objective: Kill Ambassador Infernus in Angor Fortress and bring proof of his death to Advisor Belgrum in Ironforge.",zone="Badlands",questName="An Ambassador of Evil",lore="Ambassador Infernus was sent to Angor Fortress by Ragnaros himself to mind the Shadowforge seeking lost artifacts in Uldaman. It has already meant tremendous casualties for our people, but it has obviously grown worse."},
    [4998]={name="Blood Ring",quality=2,ilvl=24,reqLevel=19,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 19-26."},
    [5000]={name="Coral Band",quality=2,ilvl=26,reqLevel=21,sourceType="container",instructions="Found inside another item."},
    [5001]={name="Heart Ring",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=22,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 23-28."},
    [5002]={name="Glowing Green Talisman",quality=2,ilvl=30,reqLevel=25,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 25-31."},
    [5003]={name="Crystal Starfire Medallion",quality=2,ilvl=31,reqLevel=26,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 26-32."},
    [5029]={name="Talisman of the Naga Lord",quality=2,ilvl=47,reqLevel=42,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Lord Sakrasis (rare spawn).",zone="Booty Bay",npc="Lord Sakrasis"},
    [5182]={name="Shiver Blade",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=15,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Gesharahan (rare spawn).",zone="Wailing Caverns",npc="Gesharahan",proc="Chance on hit: Blasts a target for 35 Frost damage."},
    [5192]={name="Thief's Blade",quality=3,ilvl=22,reqLevel=17,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Mr. Smite.",zone="The Deadmines",npc="Mr. Smite"},
    [5194]={name="Taskmaster Axe",quality=3,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Sneed (rare elite).",npc="Sneed"},
    [5196]={name="Smite's Reaver",quality=3,ilvl=22,reqLevel=17,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Mr. Smite.",zone="The Deadmines",npc="Mr. Smite"},
    [5200]={name="Impaling Harpoon",quality=3,ilvl=22,reqLevel=20,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Captain Greenskin.",zone="The Deadmines",npc="Captain Greenskin"},
    [5201]={name="Emberstone Staff",quality=3,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Captain Greenskin.",zone="The Deadmines",npc="Captain Greenskin"},
    [5279]={name="Harpy Skinner",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Serena Bloodfeather'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Darsok Swiftdagger in The Barrens. Objective: Slay Serena Bloodfeather and return her head to Darsok Swiftdagger at the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Serena Bloodfeather",lore="You did so well with the lieutenants and underlings that I'd like you to do one last thing for me. Serena Bloodfeather is the sister of a harpy named Bloodfeather who was slain by Rexxar quite a while ago."},
    [5299]={name="Gloves of the Moon",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cry of the Thunderhawk'. Starts with Jorn Skyseer in The Barrens. Objective: Find and slay a Thunderhawk, return its wings to Jorn Skyseer at Camp Taurajo.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Cry of the Thunderhawk",lore="The thunderhawk, is a fierce beast. It is time for you to face them. You must find where it roams, and bring me its wings as proof of your successful hunt."},
    [5302]={name="Cobalt Buckler",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cry of the Thunderhawk'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jorn Skyseer in The Barrens. Objective: Find and slay a Thunderhawk, return its wings to Jorn Skyseer at Camp Taurajo.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Cry of the Thunderhawk",lore="The thunderhawk, is a fierce beast. It is time for you to face them. You must find where it roams, and bring me its wings as proof of your successful hunt."},
    [5306]={name="Wind Rider Staff",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cry of the Thunderhawk'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jorn Skyseer in The Barrens. Objective: Find and slay a Thunderhawk, return its wings to Jorn Skyseer at Camp Taurajo.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Cry of the Thunderhawk",lore="The thunderhawk, is a fierce beast. It is time for you to face them. You must find where it roams, and bring me its wings as proof of your successful hunt."},
    [5309]={name="Privateer Musket",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Guns of Northwatch'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun in The Barrens. Objective: Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun of Ratchet wants you to collect 10 Theramore Medals and slay Captain Fairmount, Cannoneer Whessan and Cannoneer Smythe.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Guns of Northwatch",lore="Yet another ship from my fleet has been lost to those overzealous humans at Northwatch Hold! Those bastards must be dealt with. Their paranoia has them in a state of frenzy."},
    [5312]={name="Riveted Gauntlets",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Free From the Hold'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gilthares Firebough in The Barrens. Objective: Safely escort Gilthares Firebough back to Captain Brightsun in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Free From the Hold",lore="Finally! Someone to rescue me! I can't believe you got past the guards. These zealots from Theramore are out of their minds. They sank our ship and imprisoned me, the only survivor."},
    [5317]={name="Dry Moss Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Betrayal from Within'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mangletooth in The Barrens. Objective: Bring Lok's Skull to Thork at the Crossroads in the Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Betrayal from Within",lore="Take Lok's head to Thork in the Crossroads. He should know what has happened to my tribe without any words--ha, not that he would believe Mangletooth helped in such things."},
    [5318]={name="Zhovur Axe",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Serena Bloodfeather'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Darsok Swiftdagger in The Barrens. Objective: Slay Serena Bloodfeather and return her head to Darsok Swiftdagger at the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Serena Bloodfeather",lore="You did so well with the lieutenants and underlings that I'd like you to do one last thing for me. Serena Bloodfeather is the sister of a harpy named Bloodfeather who was slain by Rexxar quite a while ago."},
    [5319]={name="Bashing Pauldrons",quality=1,ilvl=20,reqLevel=15,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Haren Swifthoof (rare elite).",zone="The Loch",npc="Haren Swifthoof"},
    [5320]={name="Padded Lamellar Boots",quality=2,ilvl=16,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stolen Booty'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gazlowe in The Barrens. Objective: Retrieve the Shipment of Boots and Telescopic Lens for Gazlowe in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Stolen Booty",lore="While I'd like to recover all my goods, I'm sure that's not possible. Still, there's a few things that I absolutely must have! As you see, my observatory is ready to go, but it needs the smaller of the two lenses."},
    [5321]={name="Elegant Shortsword",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Serena Bloodfeather'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Darsok Swiftdagger in The Barrens. Objective: Slay Serena Bloodfeather and return her head to Darsok Swiftdagger at the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Serena Bloodfeather",lore="You did so well with the lieutenants and underlings that I'd like you to do one last thing for me. Serena Bloodfeather is the sister of a harpy named Bloodfeather who was slain by Rexxar quite a while ago."},
    [5324]={name="Engineer's Hammer",quality=2,ilvl=16,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Samophlange'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in The Barrens. Objective: Return the Samophlange to Sputtervalve in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Samophlange",lore="Pulling open the face of the control console reveals a dense jumble of wires, tubing and other strange mechanical objects--most of which seem to serve no practical purpose."},
    [5325]={name="Welding Shield",quality=2,ilvl=16,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Samophlange'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in The Barrens. Objective: Return the Samophlange to Sputtervalve in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Samophlange",lore="Pulling open the face of the control console reveals a dense jumble of wires, tubing and other strange mechanical objects--most of which seem to serve no practical purpose."},
    [5328]={name="Cinched Belt",quality=2,ilvl=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Disruption Ends'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Thork in The Barrens. Objective: Kill 8 Razormane Geomancers, 8 Razormane Defenders, and Kreenig Snarlsnout.Then bring Kreenig Snarlsnout's Tusk to Thork at the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Disruption Ends",lore="One of my scouts witnessed an attack on a caravan from Durotar. The culprits are indeed the Razormane tribe of quilboars. One of the quilboars in particular is leading the raids: Kreenig Snarlsnout."},
    [5340]={name="Cauldron Stirrer",quality=2,ilvl=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Apothecary Zamah'. Starts with Apothecary Helbrim in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Bring the Rendered Spores to Apothecary Zamah in Thunder Bluff, before the time limit is up.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Apothecary Zamah",lore="I have rendered the spores you gave me into an emulsion. I must now send it to my associate, Apothecary Zamah. If you were to carry this to her, she can offer you something from our stores of alchemical goods."},
    [5341]={name="Spore-covered Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Root Samples'. Starts with Mebok Mizzyrix in The Barrens. Objective: Bring 8 Root Samples to Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Root Samples",lore="The herbs of the Barrens are not quite like herbs in other lands. Their properties are mostly the same, but the oasis water here alters the plants; they are just slightly different."},
    [5343]={name="Barkeeper's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Raptor Horns'. Starts with Mebok Mizzyrix in The Barrens. Objective: Gather 5 Intact Raptor Horns from Sunscale Scytheclaws, and bring them to Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Raptor Horns",lore="The raptors of the Barrens are smarter than raptors in other lands. And I think all that smarts is hiding in their horns!"},
    [5344]={name="Pointed Axe",quality=2,ilvl=14,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bracers'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Regthar Deathgate in The Barrens. Objective: Bring 15 Centaur Bracers to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Centaur Bracers",lore="The Kolkar are a threat to the Horde's claims in the Barrens; we must reduce the numbers of their troops. And so, I have a bounty task for you."},
    [5345]={name="Stonewood Hammer",quality=2,ilvl=14,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bracers'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Regthar Deathgate in The Barrens. Objective: Bring 15 Centaur Bracers to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Centaur Bracers",lore="The Kolkar are a threat to the Horde's claims in the Barrens; we must reduce the numbers of their troops. And so, I have a bounty task for you."},
    [5346]={name="Orcish Battle Bow",quality=2,ilvl=14,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bracers'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Regthar Deathgate in The Barrens. Objective: Bring 15 Centaur Bracers to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Centaur Bracers",lore="The Kolkar are a threat to the Horde's claims in the Barrens; we must reduce the numbers of their troops. And so, I have a bounty task for you."},
    [5351]={name="Bounty Hunter's Ring",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hezrul Bloodmark'. Starts with Regthar Deathgate in The Barrens. Objective: Bring Hezrul's Head to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Hezrul Bloodmark",lore="Hezrul Bloodmark is the leader of the Kolkar centaurs in the Barrens. He is fierce, brutal and cunning. Defeating him would disrupt and fracture the Kolkars, greatly reducing their threat to us."},
    [5355]={name="Beastmaster's Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Isha Awak'. Starts with Mahren Skyseer in The Barrens. Objective: Bring the Heart of Isha Awak to Mahren Skyseer.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Isha Awak",lore="The grand Isha Awak is lord of these waters. Great is his strength, and solemn his pride. The humans on the coast fear him, for he has consumed many of their number."},
    [5357]={name="Ward of the Vale",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Isha Awak'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mahren Skyseer in The Barrens. Objective: Bring the Heart of Isha Awak to Mahren Skyseer.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Isha Awak",lore="The grand Isha Awak is lord of these waters. Great is his strength, and solemn his pride. The humans on the coast fear him, for he has consumed many of their number."},
    [5399]={name="Tracking Boots",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Woodland Protector'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Tarindrella in Teldrassil. Objective: Collect 8 Fel Moss and bring them to Tarindrella.",zone="Shadowglen",questName="The Woodland Protector",lore="Something evil is brewing in the forests of Teldrassil. Look long the hills to where the peaceful furbolgs used to dwell. They have deserted their homes and are amassing under the name of the Gnarlpine tribe."},
    [5404]={name="Serpent's Shoulders",quality=3,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lady Anacondra.",zone="Wailing Caverns",npc="Lady Anacondra"},
    [5443]={name="Gold-plated Buckler",quality=3,ilvl=20,reqLevel=15,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Miner Johnson.",zone="The Deadmines",npc="Miner Johnson"},
    [5540]={name="Pearl-handled Dagger",quality=2,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [5541]={name="Iridescent Hammer",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=23,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [5589]={name="Moss-covered Gauntlets",quality=1,ilvl=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Oakenscowl'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Denalan in Teldrassil. Objective: Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth wants you to collect the Gargantuan Tumor from Oakenscowl.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Oakenscowl",lore="In a cave along the southern bank of the lake, a timberling named Oakenscowl is spreading corruption to all the creatures that make Lake Al'Ameth their home."},
    [5591]={name="Rain-spotted Cape",quality=1,ilvl=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Enchanted Glade'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak in Teldrassil. Objective: Acquire 6 Bloodfeather Belts and bring them to Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak in the Oracle Glade.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Enchanted Glade",lore="I was dispatched with a small group of Sentinels here to protect the Oracle Tree from the harpies that have made nests all around the glade."},
    [5592]={name="Shackled Girdle",quality=1,ilvl=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Enchanted Glade'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak in Teldrassil. Objective: Acquire 6 Bloodfeather Belts and bring them to Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak in the Oracle Glade.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Enchanted Glade",lore="I was dispatched with a small group of Sentinels here to protect the Oracle Tree from the harpies that have made nests all around the glade."},
    [5593]={name="Crag Buckler",quality=1,ilvl=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mist'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Teldrassil. Objective: Escort Mist to Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak at the moon well near the Oracle Tree.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Mist",lore="The sabercat's fur is a distinctive gray color, blending into the surrounding forest. As she lays there, you observe that she is badly wounded, with deep lacerations across her back and stomach."},
    [5609]={name="Steadfast Cinch",quality=2,ilvl=22,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Escape Through Force'. Starts with Volcor in Darkshore. Objective: Protect Volcor until you reach the road, then speak to Terenthis in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Escape Through Force",lore="All right, force it is. Let's get out of here as soon as you're ready. We'll fight our way down to the road--Grimclaw should still be there."},
    [5610]={name="Gustweald Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cave Mushrooms'. Starts with Barithras Moonshade in Darkshore. Objective: Bring 5 Scaber Stalks and 1 Death Cap to Barithras Moonshade in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Cave Mushrooms",lore="I am devising a potion that requires rare mushrooms, mushrooms that grow only in a certain cave. The cave lies behind Cliffspring Falls, to the east and slightly north along the mountains."},
    [5613]={name="Staff of the Purifier",quality=2,ilvl=23,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Tower of Althalaxx'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Balthule Shadowstrike in Ashenvale. Objective: Talk to Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Tower of Althalaxx",lore="Ilkrud Magthrull. Yes, I have knowledge of him. He is a powerful orc warlock that makes his residence at the Fire Scar Shrine, a place of great evil in southwestern Ashenvale.",proc="Use: Purifies the friendly target, removing 1 disease effect and 1 poison effect. (5 Min Cooldown)"},
    [5614]={name="Seraph's Strike",quality=2,ilvl=31,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Tower of Althalaxx'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Balthule Shadowstrike in Ashenvale. Objective: Talk to Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Tower of Althalaxx",lore="For all the work that you have done, you deserve to be well rewarded. Return to Delgren and tell him that Athrikus Narassin lies stilled by your hand, and the Cult of the Dark Strand is beaten and scattered."},
    [5615]={name="Woodsman Sword",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mathystra Relics'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Onu in Darkshore. Objective: Bring 6 Mathystra Relics to Onu at the Grove of the Ancients.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Mathystra Relics",lore="The parchment you found at the Master's Glaive is a page from an ancient text...written by elves!"},
    [5617]={name="Vagabond Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bashal'Aran'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Asterion in Darkshore. Objective: Destroy the Ancient Moonstone Seal at the ancient flame in Ameth'Aran, then return to Asterion in Bashal'Aran.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Bashal'Aran",lore="It was the craft of one of the most powerful of the Highborne that created the seal that formed my prison. In Ameth'Aran, the ruins to the south that are twin to these, persists even today an ancient flame, blue in color."},
    [5622]={name="Clergy Ring",quality=2,ilvl=22,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Tower of Althalaxx'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Balthule Shadowstrike in Ashenvale. Objective: Talk to Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Tower of Althalaxx",lore="Ilkrud Magthrull. Yes, I have knowledge of him. He is a powerful orc warlock that makes his residence at the Fire Scar Shrine, a place of great evil in southwestern Ashenvale."},
    [5626]={name="Skullchipper",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Absent Minded Prospector'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Absent Minded Prospector",lore="Prospector Whelgar now holds the original fossil at his site in the Wetlands. When I discovered the Stone of Relu, I believed it to be the key to unlocking the mystery of the fossil."},
    [5627]={name="Relic Blade",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Absent Minded Prospector'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Absent Minded Prospector",lore="When I discovered the Stone of Relu, I believed it to be the key to unlocking the mystery of the fossil. While I traveled on the road to meet Whelgar, I was attacked by raptors and the relic was lost."},
    [5629]={name="Hammerfist Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Absent Minded Prospector'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Absent Minded Prospector",lore="So the prospector wants to send the mysterious fossil to the Explorers' League in Darnassus? I don't feel right leaving Darkshore without him."},
    [5744]={name="Pale Skinner",quality=2,ilvl=12,reqLevel=7,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Fedfennel (rare spawn).",zone="Eastern Kingdoms",npc="Fedfennel"},
