    [18948]={name="Barbaric Bracers",quality=3,ilvl=32,reqLevel=27,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [19019]={name="Thunderfury, Blessed Blade of the Windseeker",quality=5,ilvl=80,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rise, Thunderfury!'. Objective: Present the Dormant Wind Kissed Blade to Highlord Demitrian.",questName="Rise, Thunderfury!",lore="Forged for a Windseeker of the elemental lords and lost for an age. Waking it again takes the bindings of the left and right hand, the blessing of Thunderaan's own essence, and a smith willing to defy Ragnaros.",proc="Chance on hit: Blasts your enemy with lightning, dealing 300 Nature damage and then jumping to additional nearby enemies.  Each jump reduces that victim's Nature resistance by 25. "},
    [19024]={name="Arena Grand Master",quality=3,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Arena Grandmaster'. Starts with Short John Mithril in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: ProgressAvast Lubber! &nbsp; Bring me 12 trinkets of the Arena Master and then ye shall be a Grandmaster of the Gurubashi Arena! &nbsp; Arrrr!",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Arena Grandmaster",lore="Avast Lubber! Bring me 12 trinkets of the Arena Master and then ye shall be a Grandmaster of the Gurubashi Arena!",proc="Use: Absorbs 750 to 1250 damage.  Lasts 20 sec. (15 Min Cooldown)"},
    [19037]={name="Emerald Peak Spaulders",quality=2,ilvl=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Zukk'ash Report'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Hadoken Swiftstrider in Orgrimmar. Objective: Deliver the Camp Mojache Zukk'ash Report to Zilzibin Drumlore. He resides in the Drag of Orgrimmar.",zone="Feralas",questName="Zukk'ash Report",lore="You've done doubly well in addressing the threat that the Zukk'ash insects pose to Camp Mojache. The threat these things pose is far from over, and I'd like to ask you for one last task on behalf of the Horde."},
    [19039]={name="Zorbin's Water Resistant Hat",quality=2,ilvl=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Fuel for the Zapping'. Starts with Zorbin Fandazzle in Feralas. Objective: Collect 10 Water Elemental Cores from the Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays along the Forgotten Coast of Feralas, and bring them back to Zorbin Fandazzle who is near the dock there.",zone="Feralas",questName="Fuel for the Zapping",lore="When doing this though, be sure to save me the water elemental cores!"},
    [19040]={name="Zorbin's Mega-Slicer",quality=2,ilvl=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Zapped Giants'. Starts with Zorbin Fandazzle in Feralas. Objective: Use Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker to zap any kind of giant found in Feralas into a more manageable form. Bring 15 Miniaturization Residues found on the zapped versions of these giants to Zorbin Fandazzle at the docks of the Forgotten Coast, Feralas.",zone="Feralas",questName="Zapped Giants",lore="I'm going to have to do something about the giants if I stay out here! They're certainly not good for business, now are they?"},
