    [20640]={name="Southsea Head Bucket",quality=2,ilvl=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Southsea Shakedown'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Security Chief Bilgewhizzle in Tanaris. Objective: Security Chief Bilgewhizzle of Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris wants you to kill 10 Southsea Pirates, 10 Southsea Freebooters, 10 Southsea Dock Workers and 10 Southsea Swashbucklers.",zone="Tanaris",questName="Southsea Shakedown",lore="They want the impossible from me! The Steamwheedle Cartel wants me to teach the Southsea pirates a lesson."},
    [20643]={name="Undercity Reservist's Cap",quality=2,ilvl=47,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Oran's Gratitude'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Oran Snakewrithe in Undercity. Objective: Now isn't this interesting? You say you found this tablet on a small, deserted island at The Overlook Cliffs in The Hinterlands, &lt;class&gt;? Very interesting indeed. I thank you for your efforts in this matter. Our Dark Lady shall be very pleased with this discovery. Here, allow me to reward you proportionately.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Oran's Gratitude"},
    [20645]={name="Nature's Whisper",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="mail",instructions="Delivered by in-game mail."},
    [20646]={name="Sandstrider's Mark",quality=2,ilvl=59,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wanted - Deathclasp, Terror of the Sands'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Silithus. Objective: Bring Deathclasp's Pincer to Vish Kozus, Captain of the Guard.",zone="Silithus",questName="Wanted - Deathclasp, Terror of the Sands",lore="The terrible scorpid, Deathclasp, is believed to have retreated to the southern mountain range in the presence of increased silithid activity."},
    [20648]={name="Cold Forged Hammer",quality=3,ilvl=63,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hero of the Stormpike'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Prospector Stonehewer in Alterac Valley. Objective: As a hero of the Stormpike, you may choose one item from these recently plun... er, recovered treasures.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="Hero of the Stormpike"},
    [20650]={name="Desert Wind Gauntlets",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Vyral the Vile'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Huum Wildmane in Silithus. Objective: Bring Vyral's Signet Ring to Huum Wildmane in Cenarion Hold.",zone="Silithus",questName="Vyral the Vile",lore="We have discovered another base of operations for the Twilight's Hammer. It is called Twilight's Run; it is a cave tucked in the northeast corner of Silithus."},
    [20662]={name="Abyssal Plate Greaves",quality=2,ilvl=60,reqLevel=55,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Earthen Templar.",npc="Earthen Templar"},
    [20688]={name="Earthen Guard",quality=4,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Baron Kazum.",npc="Baron Kazum"},
    [20692]={name="Multicolored Band",quality=2,ilvl=60,reqLevel=55,sourceType="container",instructions="Found inside another item."},
    [20695]={name="Abyssal War Beads",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=58,sourceType="container",instructions="Found inside another item."},
    [20710]={name="Crystal Encrusted Greaves",quality=3,ilvl=63,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Armaments of War'. Starts with Geologist Larksbane in Silithus. Objective: War comes, &lt;name&gt;, and with it comes untold horrors. You have done all that could be asked of you and for that you should be rewarded.Should this... this prophecy ever come to pass...The future of us all could be at an end.These armaments will prove invaluable to your campaign in this desert.",zone="Silithus",questName="Armaments of War"},
    [20723]={name="Brann's Trusty Pick",quality=2,ilvl=62,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Brann Bronzebeard's Lost Letter'. Objective: Take Brann Bronzebeard's Letter to Bronzebeard's Encampment in southern Silithus.",zone="Silithus",questName="Brann Bronzebeard's Lost Letter",lore="To Whom It May Concern: If you're reading this, I'm either dead or soon to be dead. It's hard to say. Most of the crew is dead anyhow. Found information about a Titan."},
    [20724]={name="Corrupted Blackwood Staff",quality=2,ilvl=62,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Into The Maw of Madness'. Starts with Commander Mar'alith in Silithus. Objective: Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to find his beloved Natalia. The information that you gathered points to Hive'Regal in the south as being the area in which you may find Mistress Natalia Mar'alith.Do not forget to visit the dwarves at Bronzebeard's camp before venturing into the hive. They might have some additional work and advice for you.And &lt;name&gt;, remember the Commander's words: \"Do what you must...\".",zone="Silithus",questName="Into The Maw of Madness",lore="I need you to venture into Hive'Regal and find what became of my dearest Natalia. This will be no easy task for you. Before you dive headlong into the maw of madness, make sure that you go back and speak with those dwarves."},
    [21115]={name="Defiler's Talisman",quality=3,ilvl=53,reqLevel=48,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Rutherford Twing.",zone="Hammerfall",npc="Rutherford Twing",proc="Use: Absorbs 392 to 478 physical damage.  Lasts 15 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21116]={name="Defiler's Talisman",quality=3,ilvl=43,reqLevel=38,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Rutherford Twing.",zone="Hammerfall",npc="Rutherford Twing",proc="Use: Absorbs 310 to 378 physical damage.  Lasts 15 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21117]={name="Talisman of Arathor",quality=3,ilvl=53,reqLevel=48,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Samuel Hawke.",zone="Refuge Pointe",npc="Samuel Hawke",proc="Use: Absorbs 392 to 478 physical damage.  Lasts 15 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21118]={name="Talisman of Arathor",quality=3,ilvl=43,reqLevel=38,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Samuel Hawke.",zone="Refuge Pointe",npc="Samuel Hawke",proc="Use: Absorbs 310 to 378 physical damage.  Lasts 15 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21119]={name="Talisman of Arathor",quality=3,ilvl=33,reqLevel=28,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Samuel Hawke.",zone="Refuge Pointe",npc="Samuel Hawke",proc="Use: Absorbs 248 to 302 physical damage.  Lasts 15 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21120]={name="Defiler's Talisman",quality=3,ilvl=33,reqLevel=28,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Rutherford Twing.",zone="Hammerfall",npc="Rutherford Twing",proc="Use: Absorbs 248 to 302 physical damage.  Lasts 15 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21126]={name="Death's Sting",quality=4,ilvl=84,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from C'Thun.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="C'Thun",lore="An Old God, buried under Ahn'Qiraj by the titans rather than killed. It has been whispering to the qiraji ever since, and the whole war exists because it never stopped."},
    [21134]={name="Dark Edge of Insanity",quality=4,ilvl=84,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from C'Thun.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="C'Thun",lore="An Old God, buried under Ahn'Qiraj by the titans rather than killed. It has been whispering to the qiraji ever since, and the whole war exists because it never stopped.",proc="Chance on hit: Disorients the target, causing it to wander aimlessly for up to 3 sec."},
    [21180]={name="Earthstrike",quality=4,ilvl=66,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Champion's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 20 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Cenarius to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Champion's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them.",proc="Use: Increases your melee and ranged attack power by 280.  Effect lasts for 20 sec. (2 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21182]={name="Band of Earthen Might",quality=3,ilvl=66,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Veteran's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 7 Cenarion Combat Badges, 4 Cenarion Logistics Badges and 4 Cenarion Tactical Badges to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Veteran's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them."},
    [21184]={name="Deeprock Bracers",quality=4,ilvl=62,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stalwart's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 17 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Remulos to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Stalwart's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Windcaller Proudhorn are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them."},
    [21187]={name="Earthweave Cloak",quality=3,ilvl=62,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Volunteer's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 5 Cenarion Combat Badges, 3 Cenarion Logistics Badges and 7 Cenarion Tactical Badges to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Friendly reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Volunteer's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them."},
    [21200]={name="Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight",quality=4,ilvl=80,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Protector of Kalimdor'. Starts with Anachronos in Tanaris. Objective: ProgressNever have I seen such tenacity! The Bronze Flight grants you one final enchantment. The Timeless One himself has requested it so!Hand me your signet ring so that I may make the necessary adjustments.",zone="Tanaris",questName="The Protector of Kalimdor"},
    [21204]={name="Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight",quality=4,ilvl=75,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Path of the Conqueror'. Starts with Anachronos in Tanaris. Objective: ProgressYou honor my kind, &lt;name&gt;. Strike down the enemies of Kalimdor! Show them what it means to deface the land of eternal starlight.You have earned another enhancement. Hand me your signet ring so that I may bolster its power.",zone="Tanaris",questName="The Path of the Conqueror"},
    [21242]={name="Blessed Qiraji War Axe",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Armaments'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Armaments",lore="We have not sat idly by for a millennium. We have watched these beasts feast on their own when they have exhausted their utility. We have listened as they have plotted and schemed to destroy our world."},
    [21244]={name="Blessed Qiraji Pugio",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Armaments'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Armaments",lore="We have not sat idly by for a millennium. We have watched these beasts feast on their own when they have exhausted their utility. We have listened as they have plotted and schemed to destroy our world."},
    [21268]={name="Blessed Qiraji War Hammer",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Regalia'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Regalia",lore="I speak of Elementium, mortal. Find and bring me Imperial Qiraji Regalia and the toxic element and I shall infuse weapons of great power."},
    [21269]={name="Blessed Qiraji Bulwark",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Armaments'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Armaments",lore="We have not sat idly by for a millennium. We have watched these beasts feast on their own when they have exhausted their utility. We have listened as they have plotted and schemed to destroy our world."},
    [21272]={name="Blessed Qiraji Musket",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Armaments'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Armaments",lore="We have not sat idly by for a millennium. We have watched these beasts feast on their own when they have exhausted their utility. We have listened as they have plotted and schemed to destroy our world."},
    [21273]={name="Blessed Qiraji Acolyte Staff",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Regalia'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Regalia",lore="I speak of Elementium, mortal. Find and bring me Imperial Qiraji Regalia and the toxic element and I shall infuse weapons of great power."},
    [21275]={name="Blessed Qiraji Augur Staff",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Regalia'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Regalia",lore="I speak of Elementium, mortal. Find and bring me Imperial Qiraji Regalia and the toxic element and I shall infuse weapons of great power."},
    [21312]={name="Belt of the Den Watcher",quality=2,ilvl=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Timbermaw Ally'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Felwood. Objective: Grazle wants you to prove yourself by killing 5 Deadwood Warriors, 5 Deadwood Pathfinders, and 5 Deadwood Gardeners.",zone="Felwood",questName="Timbermaw Ally",lore="The Timbermaw are the only furbolg tribe to escape the corruption. However, many other races kill furbolg blindly now, without bothering to see if they are friend or foe."},
    [21316]={name="Leggings of the Ursa",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Deadwood of the North'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Timbermaw Hold",questName="Deadwood of the North",lore="There is a camp of Deadwood furbolgs directly to our southwest. Corruption permeates the camp, and I wish to put an end to it before they become a problem."},
    [21317]={name="Helm of the Pathfinder",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Deadwood of the North'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Timbermaw Hold",questName="Deadwood of the North",lore="There is a camp of Deadwood furbolgs directly to our southwest. Corruption permeates the camp, and I wish to put an end to it before they become a problem."},
    [21322]={name="Ursa's Embrace",quality=2,ilvl=58,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Winterfall Activity'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Salfa in Winterspring. Objective: Salfa wants you to kill 8 Winterfall Shaman, 8 Winterfall Den Watchers, and 8 Winterfall Ursa. Salfa is located just outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold in Winterspring.",zone="Timbermaw Hold",questName="Winterfall Activity",lore="The Timbermaw tend to stay to themselves. While we do allow safe passage to those we trust, we try to avoid other furbolg tribes if at all possible."},
    [21329]={name="Conqueror's Crown",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Conqueror's Crown'. Starts with Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring Vek'nilash's Circlet, 2 Idols of the Sun, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Conqueror's Crown",lore="The Twin Emperors... their incessant whispers are slowly taking a toll on my sanity. They mock me, knowing I cannot step further into their domain to save my brother Arygos."},
    [21330]={name="Conqueror's Spaulders",quality=4,ilvl=78,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Conqueror's Spaulders'. Starts with Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Command, 2 Idols of Night, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Neutral reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Conqueror's Spaulders",lore="It is said among us that the ornate shoulder armor worn by the mortal races started as an attempt to emulate the wings of a dragon."},
    [21331]={name="Conqueror's Breastplate",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Conqueror's Breastplate'. Starts with Vethsera in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring the the Carapace of the Old God, 2 Idols of War, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Conqueror's Breastplate",lore="The unmentionable Old God slowly awakens from his slumber beneath Ahn'Qiraj. The terrible fate that awaits Azeroth could come in days or years; time has no meaning for beings of his power."},
    [21332]={name="Conqueror's Legguards",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Conqueror's Legguards'. Starts with Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring Ouro's Intact Hide, 2 Idols of Death, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Kandrostrasz inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Conqueror's Legguards",lore="You seek to prove your worth to my kind, mortal? Very well, perhaps we can be of mutual assistance. The ancient sandworm, Ouro, is a being of legendary power."},
    [21333]={name="Conqueror's Greaves",quality=4,ilvl=78,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Conqueror's Greaves'. Starts with Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Command, 2 Idols of War, 5 Ivory Scarabs and 5 Gold Scarabs to Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. This quest also requires Neutral faction with the Brood of Nozdormu.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Conqueror's Greaves",lore="Qiraji magic is strong and ancient. The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon."},
    [21393]={name="Signet of Unyielding Strength",quality=4,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Signet of Unyielding Strength'. Starts with Windcaller Yessendra in Silithus. Objective: Bring 1 Qiraji Magisterial Ring, 2 Lambent Idols, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Windcaller Yessendra in Silithus. You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Signet of Unyielding Strength",lore="The rings worn by the Qiraji lieutenants are rumored to grant them formidable abilities. The corrupted gems that adorn them could, in theory, be swapped out with more pure materials to create uncorrupted versions of the rings."},
    [21394]={name="Drape of Unyielding Strength",quality=4,ilvl=67,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Drape of Unyielding Strength'. Starts with Keyl Swiftclaw in Silithus. Objective: Bring 1 Qiraji Martial Drape, 2 Onyx Idols, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Keyl Swiftclaw in Silithus. You must also obtain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Drape of Unyielding Strength",lore="I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy. I shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course."},
    [21453]={name="Mantle of the Horusath",quality=4,ilvl=72,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ossirian the Unscarred.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Ossirian the Unscarred",lore="A qiraji lieutenant holding the Ruins, whose name stopped being accurate the first time a raid used the crystals against him."},
    [21475]={name="Legplates of the Destroyer",quality=3,ilvl=74,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Moam.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Moam",lore="A stone giant pressed into qiraji service, who drains the mana of everyone fighting him and turns to rock when full."},
    [21477]={name="Ring of Fury",quality=3,ilvl=74,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Moam.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Moam",lore="A stone giant pressed into qiraji service, who drains the mana of everyone fighting him and turns to rock when full."},
    [21481]={name="Boots of the Desert Protector",quality=3,ilvl=73,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ayamiss the Hunter.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Ayamiss the Hunter"},
    [21486]={name="Gloves of the Swarm",quality=4,ilvl=68,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Buru the Gorger.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Buru the Gorger"},
    [21495]={name="Legplates of the Qiraji Command",quality=3,ilvl=71,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from General Rajaxx.",zone="The Scarab Wall",npc="General Rajaxx",lore="Commander of the qiraji army, who threw wave after wave at the Scarab Wall in the War of the Shifting Sands and came back to do it again."},
    [21505]={name="Choker of the Shifting Sands",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Fall of Ossirian'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Objective: Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",questName="The Fall of Ossirian",lore="A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished. The denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory."},
    [21506]={name="Pendant of the Shifting Sands",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Fall of Ossirian'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Objective: Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",questName="The Fall of Ossirian",lore="A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished. The denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory."},
    [21520]={name="Ravencrest's Legacy",quality=4,ilvl=76,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Treasure of the Timeless One'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jonathan the Revelator in Silithus. Objective: Greetings, champion. I am Jonathan, keeper of the sacred gong and eternal watcher of the Bronze Flight.I have been empowered by the Timeless One himself to grant you an item of your choosing from his timeless treasure trove. May it aid you in your battles against C'Thun.",zone="Silithus",questName="Treasure of the Timeless One"},
    [21522]={name="Shadowsong's Sorrow",quality=4,ilvl=76,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Treasure of the Timeless One'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jonathan the Revelator in Silithus. Objective: Greetings, champion. I am Jonathan, keeper of the sacred gong and eternal watcher of the Bronze Flight.I have been empowered by the Timeless One himself to grant you an item of your choosing from his timeless treasure trove. May it aid you in your battles against C'Thun.",zone="Silithus",questName="Treasure of the Timeless One"},
    [21526]={name="Band of Icy Depths",quality=4,ilvl=77,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Wrath of Neptulon'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Narain Soothfancy in Azshara. Objective: Use the Arcanite Buoy at the Swirling Maelstrom at the Bay of Storms in Azshara.",zone="Azshara",questName="The Wrath of Neptulon",lore="Did I mention the bad news yet? Its name is Maws: 100 feet of death and destruction. I guess I may have forgotten that little tidbit."},
    [21532]={name="Drudge Boots",quality=4,ilvl=77,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Nightmare Manifests'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Keeper Remulos in Moonglade. Objective: Defend Nighthaven from Eranikus. Do not let Keeper Remulos perish. Do not slay Eranikus. Defend yourself. Await Tyrande.",zone="Moonglade",questName="The Nightmare Manifests",lore="We must use restraint against Eranikus. We are to redeem him not destroy him. Tyrande is already en route to assist us in this task. We must weather the dragon's blows and save Nighthaven from certain destruction."},
    [21563]={name="Don Rodrigo's Band",quality=4,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Gaelden Hammersmith.",zone="Alterac Valley",npc="Gaelden Hammersmith"},
    [21567]={name="Rune of Duty",quality=3,ilvl=45,reqLevel=40,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from the Warsong Gulch quartermaster with marks of honor. Alliance: Illiyana Moonblaze at Silverwing Grove, Ashenvale. Horde: Kelm Hargunth at Mor'shan Base Camp, The Barrens."},
    [21568]={name="Rune of Duty",quality=3,ilvl=25,reqLevel=20,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from the Warsong Gulch quartermaster with marks of honor. Alliance: Illiyana Moonblaze at Silverwing Grove, Ashenvale. Horde: Kelm Hargunth at Mor'shan Base Camp, The Barrens."},
    [21581]={name="Gauntlets of Annihilation",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from C'Thun.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="C'Thun",lore="An Old God, buried under Ahn'Qiraj by the titans rather than killed. It has been whispering to the qiraji ever since, and the whole war exists because it never stopped."},
    [21586]={name="Belt of Never-ending Agony",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from C'Thun.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="C'Thun",lore="An Old God, buried under Ahn'Qiraj by the titans rather than killed. It has been whispering to the qiraji ever since, and the whole war exists because it never stopped."},
