    [21700]={name="Pendant of the Qiraji Guardian",quality=4,ilvl=73,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from The Prophet Skeram.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="The Prophet Skeram",lore="C'Thun's mouthpiece. Everything the qiraji believe, they believe because he told them the Old God said it."},
