    [22416]={name="Dreadnaught Breastplate",quality=4,ilvl=92,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dreadnaught Breastplate'. Starts with Korfax, Champion of the Light in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreadnaught Breastplate if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Breastplate, 25 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Dreadnaught Breastplate",lore="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes."},
